"\t\t\t\t\tThe BigBlueButton API calls are almost all made server-to-server. "
"If you installed the package bbb-demo on your BigBlueButton server, you get "
"a set of API examples, written in Java Server Pages (JSP), that demonstrate "
"how to use the BigBlueButton API. These demos run as a web application in "
"tomcat7. The web application makes HTTPS requests to the BigBlueButton "
"server’s API end point.\n"
"\n"
"\t\t\t\t\tYou can retrieve your BigBlueButton API parameters (API endpoint "
"and shared secret) using the command\n"
